        ['Your choices', 'Microphone access is optional until you start a scene. You may deny or revoke it at any time in iOS Settings. Without access, SCENE cannot start the live experience. During playback, iOS may show the scene and elapsed time in a Live Activity on the Dynamic Island and Lock Screen; you can manage Live Activities in iOS Settings and stop the scene in SCENE at any time.'],
        ['Children', 'SCENE is not directed to children and does not knowingly collect personal information from children. The app does not collect personal data.'],
        ['Changes and contact', 'If SCENE’s data practices change, East Noise will update this policy and its effective date before releasing the changed behavior. Questions can be sent to eastnoise26@gmail.com.'],
      ],
